WEBVTT

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:11.530
Episode 7
Waiting in the Future

00:00:22.430 --> 00:00:27.290
Master, a relationship with 
a person is like a kite.

00:00:27.290 --> 00:00:29.920
It won't fly high if you 
hold it too tightly.

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:33.050
Loosen your grip too much and it falls.

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:38.640
And when you pull strongly on 
a kite flying high in the sky,

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:43.770
the string will snap and 
it will never come back.

00:00:43.770 --> 00:00:47.760
You have a reason you're 
so close to him, don't you?

00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:49.270
I've looked into you.

00:00:49.580 --> 00:00:53.110
You're actually the Youmeishi's...

00:01:11.550 --> 00:01:17.600
<i>~Bond of the Underworld~</i>

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:38.970
Shinryuu Shouken!

00:02:42.270 --> 00:02:43.850
What have you done?!

00:02:43.850 --> 00:02:45.350
I protected my master.

00:02:48.930 --> 00:02:50.310
Come here.

00:02:55.010 --> 00:02:56.240
Take a good look.

00:02:56.240 --> 00:02:58.440
This is the result of you 
protecting your master.

00:02:58.810 --> 00:03:03.280
Mistress, please severely punish him 
for doing this to my father.

00:03:07.370 --> 00:03:11.420
It is his punishment for trying to take 
the master's life. He got what he deserved.

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:15.290
That's a false accusation! We just 
requested a ceremony service!

00:03:16.020 --> 00:03:19.370
By poisoning his tea and abducting him?

00:03:19.370 --> 00:03:20.670
What utter nonsense!

00:03:20.670 --> 00:03:24.050
Does the master even look like 
he's been affected by poison?

00:03:28.690 --> 00:03:31.690
Master, we haven't done 
anything wrong, right?

00:03:31.690 --> 00:03:35.100
I-I don't know what happened 
after I lost consciousness...

00:03:35.100 --> 00:03:39.790
Just as I said. That man 
has injured my father.

00:03:39.790 --> 00:03:43.290
Even though we have been praying 
for the Tanmoku family.

00:03:43.290 --> 00:03:45.950
Master, Mistress, we ask for fair judgment.

00:03:46.740 --> 00:03:48.700
I should have dealt with you, too.

00:03:49.140 --> 00:03:52.960
Before long, the Tanmoku family will 
be taken over by the Shinryuu family.

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:57.210
Even I, as the previous head's wife, 
have to question your motives.

00:03:56.350 --> 00:03:57.210
Shouken.

00:03:57.750 --> 00:04:02.840
Just when did the Shinryuu family overtake 
our Shito family to become number two?

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:06.720
She is right. What an impertinent bodyguard.

00:04:07.670 --> 00:04:12.480
Grandmother, whatever Shouken has 
done, he did it all for my sake.

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:15.570
Oh? Then what is this?

00:04:16.330 --> 00:04:18.610
It is a secret message sent by Shouken.

00:04:19.140 --> 00:04:21.730
We found this in Shouken's room.

00:04:27.340 --> 00:04:30.510
The body of the Youmeishi is divine.

00:04:31.030 --> 00:04:36.660
Anything that leaves your body must be 
burned so that no one can misuse it.

00:04:38.220 --> 00:04:42.720
Were you planning to curse the Youmeishi 
by secretly holding on to his hair?

00:04:43.330 --> 00:04:45.400
Don't lump me in with the likes of you.

00:04:45.400 --> 00:04:46.590
Shinryuu Shouken!

00:04:46.980 --> 00:04:48.390
I allowed you to possess a gun

00:04:48.390 --> 00:04:51.250
and come and go from the 
mansion because I trusted you.

00:04:52.540 --> 00:04:56.600
It seems I have been a 
poor judge of character.

00:04:57.170 --> 00:04:58.120
But that—

00:04:58.120 --> 00:04:59.290
Be quiet!

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:04.360
Kiya, do you know what the actual problem is?

00:05:04.710 --> 00:05:07.070
You have given him too much authority,

00:05:07.430 --> 00:05:11.410
and so he ignores the rules of the 
Tanmoku family and does as he pleases.

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:16.210
That is why you bear responsibility 
for this incident as well.

00:05:19.730 --> 00:05:25.340
Kiya, this is what happens when 
you rely on someone too much.

00:05:35.780 --> 00:05:38.350
Hey, what are you going to do with Shouken?

00:05:38.910 --> 00:05:44.550
Master, he not only sent a secret message, 
but also meant to betray you.

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:47.030
That's impossible!

00:05:47.030 --> 00:05:50.390
Everything will be revealed once 
we break the secret message's code.

00:05:50.390 --> 00:05:53.210
What are you saying about a 
member of the Shinryuu family?

00:05:54.630 --> 00:05:56.490
They want to deal with you themselves.

00:05:56.490 --> 00:05:59.540
They're disappointed by your betrayal.

00:06:00.610 --> 00:06:01.790
Betrayal, huh?

00:06:02.330 --> 00:06:03.910
There has to be some kind of mistake!

00:06:03.910 --> 00:06:07.040
Shouken wouldn't betray me. 
I guarantee it as his master!

00:06:07.040 --> 00:06:07.990
Master.

00:06:10.770 --> 00:06:11.950
It is true.

00:06:12.770 --> 00:06:17.550
My objective in coming to the 
Tanmoku family was to monitor you.

00:06:17.550 --> 00:06:19.190
On whose orders?

00:06:19.870 --> 00:06:21.940
I can't say any more.

00:06:21.940 --> 00:06:27.320
Shinryuu Shouken, what is your reason 
for staying with the Tanmoku family?

00:06:27.790 --> 00:06:31.030
I just want to protect Tanmoku Ki.

00:06:35.860 --> 00:06:37.180
Can you crack it?

00:06:37.180 --> 00:06:39.170
The parts we could decipher

00:06:39.170 --> 00:06:41.500
have to do with the Tanmoku 
family and the Youmeishi.

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:44.010
This seems likely to be an information leak.

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:49.690
The letter is numbered, which means 
he's likely sent dozens over the years.

00:06:50.630 --> 00:06:52.180
Dozens?

00:06:55.980 --> 00:06:59.810
I can't even protect you, 
despite being head of the family.

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:03.440
I am sorry for keeping quiet about it.

00:07:04.530 --> 00:07:06.190
I'm sure you had your reasons.

00:07:06.190 --> 00:07:08.490
Did someone from the 
Tanmoku family threaten you?

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:13.700
No one is threatening me. Honestly.

00:07:15.310 --> 00:07:18.700
My duty was to protect you.

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:21.830
I am proud I could fulfill that duty.

00:07:23.010 --> 00:07:24.330
Shouken...

00:07:24.740 --> 00:07:28.210
Master, remember what I told you 
when we were flying the kite?

00:07:28.690 --> 00:07:30.130
When we were flying the kite?

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:34.470
I believe it was that a relationship 
with a person is like a kite.

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:37.110
It won't fly high if you 
hold on to it too tightly.

00:07:37.110 --> 00:07:39.260
Loosen your grip too much and it falls.

00:07:39.740 --> 00:07:42.480
And when you pull strongly on 
a kite flying high in the sky,

00:07:43.580 --> 00:07:47.110
the string will snap and 
it will never come back.

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:49.740
Why are you saying all of this now?!

00:07:50.070 --> 00:07:53.700
Master, everything in this world has an end.

00:07:54.630 --> 00:08:00.950
But the only thing that goes on forever 
is the thoughts of life, the soul.

00:08:01.570 --> 00:08:04.950
A soul exists beyond the limits of time.

00:08:04.950 --> 00:08:07.460
It is both the end and the beginning.

00:08:08.010 --> 00:08:12.260
One day, you may even meet such a soul.

00:08:14.100 --> 00:08:16.300
It exists in a different dimension

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:19.000
where the present and the future 
progress at the same time.

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:20.420
Everything in this universe

00:08:20.420 --> 00:08:23.190
is nothing more than a checkpoint 
in the flow of time and space.

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:25.900
Shouken, what are you talking about?

00:08:28.730 --> 00:08:32.010
Master, please hold out your hand.

00:08:40.750 --> 00:08:42.150
It's your birthday, right?

00:08:43.610 --> 00:08:46.540
Y-You knew when my real birthday was?

00:08:47.940 --> 00:08:50.550
I wasn't able to prepare a 
proper present for you though.

00:08:54.180 --> 00:08:56.030
You knew all along...

00:08:57.780 --> 00:08:59.600
The Tanmoku family is complicated.

00:09:00.110 --> 00:09:04.040
Do you understand? While you may not 
be able to trust people's words,

00:09:04.040 --> 00:09:05.890
that is not the case for spirits.

00:09:05.890 --> 00:09:08.330
Please find a spirit shadow.

00:09:09.210 --> 00:09:11.940
I cannot be with you anymore.

00:09:12.470 --> 00:09:15.610
I don't want a spirit shadow. 
Don't go away, Shouken.

00:09:15.610 --> 00:09:17.990
I'm not going anywhere.

00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:25.030
I swear it.

00:09:25.030 --> 00:09:28.870
Shinryuu Shouken will remain 
by your side forever.

00:09:29.450 --> 00:09:31.000
Shouken, no.

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:35.510
I don't want to lose you!

00:09:44.460 --> 00:09:45.750
Master, what are you...

00:09:49.740 --> 00:09:52.230
Let's leave here together.

00:09:53.620 --> 00:09:57.110
We have a problem! Shinryuu Shouken 
has escaped with the master!

00:09:57.110 --> 00:09:58.630
What?!

00:10:02.230 --> 00:10:04.330
Master, where are we going?

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:07.110
It doesn't matter. We're leaving here.

00:10:07.110 --> 00:10:09.480
You're the Youmeishi. 
What about the ceremony?

00:10:09.480 --> 00:10:12.090
It's fine. They have Jimei-san and Jiun.

00:10:12.540 --> 00:10:16.400
No matter what happens,
you have to get away.

00:10:16.400 --> 00:10:17.630
Master!

00:10:21.660 --> 00:10:24.470
We won't let you get away, Shinryuu Shouken.

00:10:36.780 --> 00:10:37.750
Master.

00:10:38.360 --> 00:10:40.200
You mustn't.

00:10:41.060 --> 00:10:45.840
Look. This is irrefutable evidence that 
he has been leaking secrets about you

00:10:45.840 --> 00:10:46.830
and the Tanmoku family for years.

00:11:01.470 --> 00:11:04.100
He's been receiving 
orders from the outside.

00:11:04.450 --> 00:11:07.220
It means you were being 
manipulated by him, too.

00:11:07.590 --> 00:11:08.890
Think about it.

00:11:08.890 --> 00:11:12.980
Has there been anything he hasn't been 
involved in since you became the head?

00:11:13.330 --> 00:11:17.590
He knows my birthday! He could've 
killed me at any time if he wanted to.

00:11:25.060 --> 00:11:27.700
Sh-Shouken?

00:11:33.570 --> 00:11:35.710
Sh-Shouken?

00:11:42.100 --> 00:11:44.970
Why? Why are you doing this?

00:11:48.610 --> 00:11:50.980
Put the gun down, Shouken!

00:11:53.600 --> 00:11:55.700
Yes, I understand.

00:11:59.280 --> 00:12:01.510
Yuu-san

00:12:03.030 --> 00:12:07.740
Shinryuu Shouken, if anything happens to him,
 you won't get out of here alive.

00:12:11.130 --> 00:12:13.960
Sh-Shouken...

00:12:27.820 --> 00:12:29.260
Stop. Stop it!

00:12:30.410 --> 00:12:33.350
Master, do you remember?

00:12:34.090 --> 00:12:36.900
You must not trust people so easily.

00:12:39.020 --> 00:12:40.990
Even if you have the 
mirror of the underworld,

00:12:41.490 --> 00:12:43.860
you cannot see through people's hearts.

00:12:45.990 --> 00:12:48.370
Shouken, don't shoot!

00:12:49.230 --> 00:12:51.370
Hey, stop! Don't do it!

00:12:57.470 --> 00:12:59.000
Goodbye.

00:13:08.390 --> 00:13:11.260
Shouken!

00:13:50.170 --> 00:13:53.170
Shouken... hang in there.

00:13:55.740 --> 00:13:56.620
Shouken!

00:14:02.990 --> 00:14:06.180
Please let me rest a bit,

00:14:08.060 --> 00:14:09.700
master.

00:14:12.010 --> 00:14:13.100
Shouken...

00:14:14.010 --> 00:14:16.390
Shouken, wake up.

00:14:16.390 --> 00:14:19.050
Don't die. You can't die!

00:14:19.050 --> 00:14:20.340
I won't forgive you!

00:14:20.340 --> 00:14:23.690
Don't touch me! Let me go!

00:14:27.420 --> 00:14:30.180
Shouken!

00:14:45.300 --> 00:14:46.740
These tendrils are...

00:14:47.780 --> 00:14:52.530
<i>conveying Tanmoku Ki's pain and 
draining my power at the same time.</i>

00:14:52.950 --> 00:14:55.020
<i>Is he going to suck me in, too?</i>

00:14:55.020 --> 00:14:59.900
I get it now. So you've been 
with Tanmoku Ki this whole time?

00:14:59.900 --> 00:15:03.540
He still blames himself, even now 
believing that he killed you!

00:15:04.660 --> 00:15:11.050
He's continued to agonize and suffer 
for years! Why won't you let him go?!

00:15:21.210 --> 00:15:26.480
The only one who can remove 
the seal is his spirit shadow.

00:15:26.480 --> 00:15:30.980
Only you can travel to the underworld 
and save him from the nightmares.

00:15:30.980 --> 00:15:34.460
<i>Crap, I'm going to get sucked in, too.</i>

00:15:36.420 --> 00:15:38.830
<i>What can I do to destroy him?</i>

00:15:42.700 --> 00:15:46.410
Master, a relationship with 
a person is like a kite.

00:15:46.410 --> 00:15:49.460
It won't fly high if you hold on to it...

00:15:58.720 --> 00:16:03.310
...the string will snap and 
it will never come back.

00:16:37.030 --> 00:16:37.930
Is that...

00:16:42.550 --> 00:16:44.560
Tanmoku Ki?

00:16:52.620 --> 00:16:53.950
Tanmoku Ki!

00:16:56.540 --> 00:17:02.970
I kept waiting for him, 
but he never appeared.

00:17:02.970 --> 00:17:06.830
Now I know the reason 
his soul never came to meet me.

00:17:07.750 --> 00:17:11.750
Even though he was dead, 
the Tanmoku family used his body,

00:17:11.750 --> 00:17:15.720
so of course he wouldn't come 
to see me, or forgive me.

00:17:16.200 --> 00:17:18.220
It's not your fault.

00:17:18.220 --> 00:17:20.560
Keika, I told you, didn't I?

00:17:20.930 --> 00:17:24.100
That it's harder for those left 
behind than for those who are dead.

00:17:25.110 --> 00:17:26.270
I meant it.

00:17:26.900 --> 00:17:28.690
I hated parting like that.

00:17:28.690 --> 00:17:31.370
I at least wanted him to tell me why.

00:17:33.260 --> 00:17:36.550
I waited for him every single day.

00:17:37.490 --> 00:17:41.750
But no matter how long I waited,

00:17:43.510 --> 00:17:45.110
he never came.

00:17:48.170 --> 00:17:52.130
You have me. I'll never leave you.

00:17:52.130 --> 00:17:55.130
I'll be waiting in the future.

00:18:16.750 --> 00:18:18.990
I see, so he's awake.

00:18:18.990 --> 00:18:20.510
How is Keika doing?

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:23.270
He is looking after Ki-niisan.

00:18:23.270 --> 00:18:24.370
I'm glad he's all right.

00:18:24.840 --> 00:18:27.500
He did an incredible job.

00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:29.750
Then the ceremony tomorrow...

00:18:29.750 --> 00:18:32.000
It will go on as planned.

00:18:32.770 --> 00:18:38.070
The Shinryuu family might be behind
 the recent attack on the master.

00:18:38.590 --> 00:18:41.010
Will we be moving Shinryuu Shouken?

00:18:41.700 --> 00:18:45.150
Let's leave things to the 
capable spirit shadow.

00:18:45.150 --> 00:18:48.320
We cannot move carelessly anymore.

00:18:48.320 --> 00:18:53.110
I knew this day would come, sooner or later.

00:18:54.090 --> 00:18:57.570
Shin Shiyou, you've known Tanmoku Ki 
for a long time, haven't you?

00:18:57.970 --> 00:18:59.710
Yes, I have.

00:18:59.710 --> 00:19:06.200
Tanmoku-san used to be very cheerful. 
That was when he shone the most.

00:19:11.330 --> 00:19:13.550
I hate Shouken.

00:19:13.550 --> 00:19:16.710
It's all his fault that Tanmoku-san changed.

00:19:17.420 --> 00:19:20.840
What hurt Tanmoku-san the 
most wasn't that he died,

00:19:21.300 --> 00:19:24.130
but that he ended everything so recklessly.

00:19:24.780 --> 00:19:26.560
He was still a child.

00:19:26.560 --> 00:19:30.850
How much do you think he had to suppress 
himself to become like he is now?

00:19:32.110 --> 00:19:37.820
I heard that during Shouken's funeral, 
Tanmoku-san did not cry.

00:19:37.820 --> 00:19:42.620
And seven days after Shouken's death, 
he cut his hair in front of his grave.

00:19:50.910 --> 00:19:54.750
You should be grateful to Shouken 
for not taking your life.

00:19:55.970 --> 00:19:58.490
If any one of you dies,

00:19:59.380 --> 00:20:03.130
the truth of the matter will be revealed 
by the mirror of the underworld.

00:20:03.810 --> 00:20:06.100
Do your best to live long lives.

00:20:07.300 --> 00:20:12.340
If you die before me, I will 
immediately reveal the truth.

00:20:14.130 --> 00:20:19.360
He probably thought the person who 
protected him would never appear again.

00:20:19.360 --> 00:20:21.630
He changed after that.

00:20:22.490 --> 00:20:26.690
They probably thought they could manipulate
 Tanmoku-san like they did before

00:20:26.690 --> 00:20:30.510
if they got rid of Shouken,
 but they were wrong.

00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:32.880
It's laughable, isn't it?

00:20:32.880 --> 00:20:36.730
They thought they could manipulate 
the strongest Youmeishi in history.

00:20:40.590 --> 00:20:45.930
Shinryuu Shouken might've been the only 
person who could put Tanmoku-san so at ease.

00:20:46.400 --> 00:20:49.620
He wrapped up Tanmoku-san in a perfect world,

00:20:49.620 --> 00:20:54.930
but when that world was destroyed, 
no one else was able to guide him.

00:20:55.460 --> 00:21:00.280
Shouken made Tanmoku-san as he 
is now through his own death.

00:21:01.060 --> 00:21:06.280
But why did Tanmoku-san make you
 his spirit shadow after a few years?

00:21:06.790 --> 00:21:07.820
Me?

00:21:09.500 --> 00:21:13.500
Are you an old acquaintance of Tanmoku-san's?

00:21:13.850 --> 00:21:15.410
I-I don't think so.

00:21:15.950 --> 00:21:18.900
Perhaps long before you died...

00:21:20.830 --> 00:21:24.380
With a Tanmoku-san we don't know...

00:21:26.750 --> 00:21:28.090
Put that over there.

00:21:30.780 --> 00:21:36.090
<i>Rain again? I hope tomorrow's 
ceremony goes smoothly...</i>

00:21:41.100 --> 00:21:43.610
My lord, the preparations are complete.

00:21:43.610 --> 00:21:45.070
Good.

00:21:49.100 --> 00:21:55.110
I will bring you back soon, Shouken.

00:23:26.020 --> 00:23:40.040
Next Episode
Preview

00:23:27.670 --> 00:23:30.740
He's still alive.

00:23:31.370 --> 00:23:34.720
Lending himself to me.

00:23:35.050 --> 00:23:40.040
<b>The Scene That He Sees</b>

00:23:35.700 --> 00:23:38.140
Forgive me.
 I won't run away anymore.

00:23:38.970 --> 00:23:40.040
Let's end this.
